{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13206","headline":"送邹判官赴河南 · 皇甫冉","name":"送邹判官赴河南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看君发原隰，四牡去皇皇。\n始罢沧江吏，还随粉署郎。\n海沂军未息，河畔岁仍荒。\n征税人全少，榛芜虏近亡。\n所行知宋远，相隔叹淮长。\n早晚裁书寄，银钩伫八行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}